		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">Census of Agriculture</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">United States Department of Agriculture Census of Agriculture</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://www.nass.usda.gov/AgCensus/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The Census of Agriculture provides extensive data about U.S. agriculture at the country, state and county level.  The census is conducted every 5 years, and it gathers uniform, detailed data about U.S. farms and ranches and their operators.  Data from recent censuses are available in different formats, but historical censuses (back to 1840) are available in pdf format.</r3d:description>
